graph LR
    subgraph laptop [Your laptop]
        designer["Visual designer<br/>project.edsui to generated QML"]
        studio["EmbeddedDisplay Studio<br/>validate, preview, deploy"]
        child["Preview child<br/>a second interpreter<br/>PySide6 or PySide2, per the manifest"]
        cli["deploy_to_hmi.sh<br/>the same thing, in CI"]
    end
    subgraph panel [The panel]
        gui["hmi-gui.service<br/>loader + tag engine"]
        current["/opt/hmi_apps/current<br/>the customer bundle"]
        runtimes["Qt runtimes<br/>PySide6, plus PySide2 at /opt/hmi-python-qt5"]
        display["Connected display<br/>DRM reports its real geometry"]
        hwd["hmi-hwd.service<br/>libgpiod, IIO, UART"]
    end
    designer -->|generates a bundle| studio
    studio -->|runs it unmapped, streams frames back| child
    studio -->|ssh: upload + hmi-install| gui
    cli -->|ssh: upload + hmi-install| gui
    gui --> current
    current --> runtimes
    hwd -->|tags, UDP/JSON on loopback| gui
    gui -->|commands| hwd
    display -.->|probed on connect; the bezel and the canvas follow it| studio
